Looking at the log, I suspect this fails in versions 21.1.183 and onward, since NeoForge updated FML. Is there a fix? The issue seems to be here: https://github.com/thedarkcolour/KotlinForForge/blob/8879ce507874a7ad9e1873e97024545df2d36a64/src/kfflang/neoforge/kotlin/thedarkcolour/kotlinforforge/neoforge/AutoKotlinEventBusSubscriber.kt#L100

I'm making a 1.20.1 Forge mod with Kotlin For Forge, and when i try to load it, i get this message:

```
Mod File main needs language provider kotlinforforge:4.10 or above to load
We have found none
```

I tried manually installing the latest Kotlin For Forge mod into `run/mods`, but no success.

