This is caused by Forge's move to SLF4J in 1.19, which means the [`LogMarkers` fields changed types](https://github.com/MinecraftForge/MinecraftForge/blob/1.19.x/fmlloader/src/main/java/net/minecraftforge/fml/loading/LogMarkers.java) (to SLF4J's `Marker`) and KFF can't find them. Should be pretty simple to fix with a move from Log4J to SLF4J here as well.

